<title>NORWAY: Norway increases 2001 bond by 2.0 bln crowns. [CORRECTED 11:41 GMT]</title>
<headline>Norway increases 2001 bond by 2.0 bln crowns. [CORRECTED 11:41 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2 billion crowns</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: May 31, 2001</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: March 17, 0900 gmt</p>
<p>NOTES: This is a Dutch auction and an expansion of government bond S466. </p>
<p>(Corrects code number of government bond from S467 to S466.)</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
